&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We're transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We'll build what's next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Capability to apply abstract reuse patterns to integrations and code both on platform and elsewhere using one or more nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to manipulate how Salesforce leverages, utilizes, and generates nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide technical assistance and leadership for medium to large financial institutions and Implementation Service Consultants when building integrations into the nCino/Force.com platform using the nCino Integration Framework.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Begin to co-lead integrations from third-party systems into the nCino platform using any number of technical solutions based on the desired and proper approach for each unique project.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Document process and procedure to help streamline integration methodology.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build and document testing requirements for unique projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide solution and integration development with Salesforce.com including requirements, functional specs, design, custom development, integration, testing and deployment.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Evaluate vendor API and interface specifications.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Handle multiple projects effectively while continuing to deliver exceptional quality.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Work independently and prioritize time and projects appropriately.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Translate customer requirements into implementation plans.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive customer success with a team player attitude.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design a salesforce solution that meets the needs of the customer.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Effectively track time and bill for hours worked on customer projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assist sales and sales engineering on technical prospect calls when required.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Leverage AI/ML capabilities to enhance integration frameworks, solution design, system automation, and operational efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Support the responsible use of AI-driven approaches in cloud-based solutions, DevOps practices, and Salesforce architecture to drive customer success and innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stay informed on emerging AI technologies and assist the team in identifying opportunities for scalable and secure AI integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Typically requires a minimum of 8 years of related experience/ proficiency with a bachelor’s degree; or 6 years and a Master’s / Advanced degree; or equivalent work experience (as applicable). Some barriers to entry exist at this level, requiring department review.'&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to design, build, articulate and defend architectural designs, primarily around integrations, but including some basic UI components and designs&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to support a dev ops process and build solutions with various software development practices&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Able to apply engineering principles to code, flow, and integration patterns including on and off platform tools&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to document more complex solutions and customer facing documentation for work performed&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce Dev401 certification&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong research, analytical and creative problem-solving skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Advanced knowledge of data management, SQL and RDBMS technologies.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience using ETL/integration platforms&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Financial Services experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Salesforce.com developer toolkit IDE, Migration Tool, Web Services.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Exposure to Salesforce.com configuration and custom development.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent understanding of object-oriented concepts and design patterns, as well as prior work with object-oriented languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Large FI experience, particularly with the Loan Origination/Servicing Systems, Enterprise Architecture framework&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Informatica experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Apex, SOQL, XML, JavaScript.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce System Architect.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Object-oriented languages such as Java, Ruby, C#, C++.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ETL/integration platforms such as Cast Iron, Informatica, SnapLogic, etc.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong presentation and communication skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong customer and professional skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
